t of the triangular base.\n    length (float or int): The length of the prism.\n\n    Returns:\n    int: The volume of the triangular prism, calculated as (base * height / 2) * length.\n    """\n    area = (base * height) / 2\n    volume = area * length\n    return int(volume)\n</answer>'
